 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108276 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "90be31bd-1c47-5130-97ec-e3825ca4c6f0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108277 #edb/ref 1080 "5x^{4}y^{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108277 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108277 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a5982ed0-fe74-5621-8562-03e7fb69a13b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108278 #edb/ref 1080 "5x^{4}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108278 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108278 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d50ab71d-2ccf-5a9e-868c-1f54765cd38c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108279 #edb/ref 1080 "5x^{4}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108279 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108279 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3d61dad8-086e-5855-a2b6-9856d58583d3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108280 #edb/ref 1080 "4x^{4}y^{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108280 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186108280 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "664ab66a-c4dd-50f3-a6da-222e8a631006" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110299 #edb/ref 1069 "e-1088" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110299 #edb/ref 1071 "Simplify the expression $\\left(x^2y\\right)^3\\cdot x^2y$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110299 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ee3fd0ee-77a9-5ebb-9bc9-c7439f5946b4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110299 #edb/ref 1074 "We start by using the power of product rule:\n\n$$\n(x^{2}y)^{3} \\cdot x^{2}y =; (x^{2})^{3} \\cdot y^{3} \\cdot x^{2}y\n$$\n\nThen, we use the power rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx^{2 \\cdot 3} \\cdot y^{3} \\cdot x^{2}y &=  \\\\\n&= x^{6} \\cdot y^{3} \\cdot x^{2}y\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we use the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx^{6} \\cdot y^{3} \\cdot x^{2}y = \\\\\n&= x^{6} \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y^{3} \\cdot y = \\\\\nx^{6 + 2} \\cdot y^{3 + 1} &=  \\\\\nx^{8} \\cdot y^{4} &=  \\\\\n&= x^{8}y^{4}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110300 #edb/ref 1069 "e-1089" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110300 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $a=2x^3$ and $b=\\dfrac{x}{y}$, express $ab^2$ in terms of $x$ and $y$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110300 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d8aca072-8ed5-5d49-8d4e-8bcc96a27ddb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110300 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we substitute for $a$ and $b$:\n\n$$\nab^{2} = 2x^{3}(\\frac{x}{y})^{2}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the power of quotient rule:\n\n$$\n2x^{3}(\\frac{x}{y})^{2} = 2x^{3}(\\frac{x^{2}}{y^{2}})\n$$\n\nFinally, we multiply and apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2x^{3}(\\frac{x^{2}}{y^{2}}) &=  \\\\\n\\frac{2x^{3} \\cdot x^{2}}{y^{2}} &=  \\\\\n\\frac{2x^{3 + 2}}{y^{2}} &=  \\\\\n&= \\frac{2x^{5}}{y^{2}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110301 #edb/ref 1069 "e-1091" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110301 #edb/ref 1071 "Simplify the expression $\\dfrac {\\sqrt{y}} {\\sqrt[3]{y}}$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110301 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "cf539049-76f2-56c0-a890-00c2d767c0a8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110301 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we rewrite the radicals as fractional exponents:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{y}}{\\sqrt[3]{y}} = \\frac{y^{1/2}}{y^{1/3}}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the quotient rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{y^{1/2}}{y^{1/3}} &=  \\\\\ny^{1/2 - 1/3} &=  \\\\\ny^{3/6 - 2/6} &=  \\\\\n&= y^{1/6}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we express the result as a radical:\n\n$$\ny^{1/6} = \\sqrt[6]{y}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110661 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049729 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110661 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050208 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110661 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050802 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110661 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186110915 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110661 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186111165 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110661 #edb/ref 1039 "Combining the Rules o